role: local orientation anchor
authority_file_mutability: read_only_without_exact_human_artifact_and_operation_authorization

anchors:
  - .uai/totem.uai is positive operating authority.
  - .uai/taboo.uai is prohibited-direction authority.
  - MiRust.com remains a one-way Rust-family orientation source, not a replacement for local authority.
  - MemoryEndpoints.com has the two separate authorized uses defined in local totem and taboo files.

boundary: Deployment and runtime controls remain locally owned. When an anchor blocks action, no-op and create a bounded human review request rather than weakening the contract.
